    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Finding the connection",
     "texto": [
      "To place a missing sentence, look for words that connect it with what came before: **det** (that), **den** (that one), **derfor** (that's why), **dog** (however).",
      "If the sentence begins with **Det** or **Den**, it usually refers to something already mentioned."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Read before answering",
     "texto": [
      "First read the whole text, then the questions. That way you know what information to look for and don't waste time.",
      "Short answers: copy the exact word, changing the form if necessary."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
